msgctxt "#33198"
msgid "Speeds up builds and menu loading by running several tasks at once. Uses more CPU and memory.\nEnable on desktop PCs with 4+ cores and plenty of RAM. Keep off on low-power devices (Shield, Fire Stick, SoC boxes) - it can cause lockups and crashes there. [B]Default:[/B] [B][COLOR=white]OFF[/COLOR][/B]"
